<!-- Reconciliation (DESIGN §12, R13 step 3b): `bmv-trader desk-reconcile` through
     scripts/reconcile.sh every 15 minutes, 8:00 to 14:45 Mac time, which is 9:00 to 15:45 ET on a
     Mac set to US Central time (tests/deploy.rs checks this). Every day, market open or not, since
     positions and GTC stops live at any hour. Report only; it never places or cancels an order.
     It runs target/release, never trial 10's pinned copy. Install: deploy/README.md -->
